title: "NBA Shot Selection and the Hot Hand"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered, reproducible study of how NBA players change their next shot after a make or a
  miss, using 1.8 million field-goal attempts from 2018-19 to 2025-26, with an interactive dashboard.
